</section>
<section id="S5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.3 </span>Ablation Study</h3>

<div id="S5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Components on Backbone.</span> To illustrate the influence of each improvement for the improved Hourglass transformer, we report the ablation study shown in Table <a href="#S5.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 5.3 Ablation Study ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ Topology Sculptor, Shape Refiner: Discrete Diffusion Model for High-Fidelity 3D Meshes Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>. It can be observed that adding cross-attention and multi-level RoPE can improve the quality of generated text.</p>
</div>
