<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 4</span>: </span><span id="S5.T4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Ablation study about components in Hourglass on ShapeNet. N/A indicates that the model cannot converge within the same number of training steps.</span></figcaption>
